   "speech": "先看清任务。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 96.75,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "给一条一百点的序列，判它属于三类中的哪一类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 101.51,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "最直接的做法的整条序列算距离。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 105.35,
   "dur": 4.74,
   "speech": "上一集试过，欧氏和 DTW 都不到五成。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 110.27,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "原因之一是：判别信息只占一小段。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 114.38,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "其余九十几点都是背景。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 117.5,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "真实数据里能看见这件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 120.81,
   "dur": 5.29,
   "speech": "中创智领，装备组，到模板的距离二点一九七五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 126.29,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "同方股份，电子组，距离零点零零零二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 130.85,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "同一条模板，在两条序列上差了一万倍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 135.43,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "所以别拿整条序列比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 138.32,
   "dur": 2.15,
   "speech": "拿一小段比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 140.65,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "这一小段叫 shapelet。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 143.53,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "定义是：从某条序列里截出的连续子序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 147.97,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "长短由我们搜，比如八、十二、二十。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 152.63,
   "dur": 4.55,
   "speech": "它对每条序列的距离，是滑动窗口最小距离。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 157.36,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "窗口内先做 z 归一化，形状才可比。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 161.61,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "然后找一个阈值，把一类和其余分开。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 165.67,
   "dur": 3.71,
   "speech": "分开得好不好，用信息增益衡量。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 169.56,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "搜索目标就是增益最大的那一段。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 173.11,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "搜索空间有多大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 175.75,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "每条序列，长度八有九十三个起点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 179.71,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "长度十二八十九个，长度二十八十一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 183.77,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "合起来二百六十三个起点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 186.8,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "九十条训练序列，两万三千六百七十个候选。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 191.41,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "每个候选都要在九十条序列上滑一遍。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 195.68,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "这就是全搜索要二十二秒的原因。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 199.4,
   "dur": 2.03,
   "speech": "分数怎么算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 201.61,
   "dur": 4.91,
   "speech": "训练集里每类取一条最好的模板，组成分类器。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 206.7,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "测试时算三条模板的距离，取最近的那类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 211.29,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "还要问一句：这个差别是真的吗。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 214.75,
   "dur": 4.29,
   "speech": "用 ANOVA 的 F 和 Kruskal 的 H 两个检验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "problem",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 219.21,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "好，先把形状这个词讲清楚。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 226.06,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "一条序列 x，长度 n。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 229.33,
   "dur": 4.93,
   "speech": "一个候选片段 s，长度 L，从位置 p 开始。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 234.44,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "s 是 x 的连续子序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 237.71,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "候选 s 对另一条序列 y 的距离，这样定义。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 242.32,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "把 y 的每个窗口拿出来，各自 z 归一化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 246.73,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "算欧氏距离，取最小值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 249.98,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "距离等于，所有窗口里最小的那个欧氏距离。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 254.73,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "z 归一化是减均值、除标准差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 258.76,
   "dur": 3.95,
   "speech": "为什么要归一化：幅度不该影响形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 262.89,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "为什么取最小：形状可以出现在任何位置。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 267.24,
   "dur": 2.61,
   "speech": "有了距离，就能排序。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 270.03,
   "dur": 4.91,
   "speech": "把九十条序列按到 s 的距离从小到大排。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 275.12,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "每个位置切一刀，左边判正类，右边判负类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 280.06,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "刀切在哪里，由信息熵决定。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 283.5,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "熵的公式：H 等于负的 sum p log2 p。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 287.77,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "两类时，熵最大是一 bit，当两类各半。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 292.36,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speech": "增益等于父熵，减去左右子熵的加权平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 297.01,
   "dur": 3.78,
   "speech": "权重是两边样本数占全体的比例。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 300.98,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "对第 c 类做一对其余，就是二分类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 304.89,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "三分类时，每类各算一次，取最大的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 309.24,
   "dur": 3.21,
   "speech": "阈值取相邻两个距离的中点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 312.62,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "只在中点严格大于前一点时才切。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 316.54,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "这是为了不把相等的距离切开。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 320.02,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "注意一个容易被忽略的细节：方向。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 323.72,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "通常假设：距离小，才像这个类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 327.49,
   "dur": 4.65,
   "speech": "但增益对方向是对称的，反向切同样高分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 332.31,
   "dur": 3.83,
   "speech": "反向的意思是：距离大，才像这个类。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 336.32,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "本集的最优模板就是反向的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 339.68,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "它从第一类的序列里截出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 342.85,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "却对第三类判别最好。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 345.81,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "因为第三类里没有这段八周期形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 349.65,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "第三类的距离全都大于一点二八六六。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 353.97,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "其余两类全在一点二零三六以下。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 357.81,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "这条分界线，正好把第三类隔离在外。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 362.04,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "所以看 shapelet 不能只看模板长什么样。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 366.34,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "还要看它站在哪一边。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 369.24,
   "dur": 2.25,
   "speech": "接下来是 PIPs。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 371.67,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "PIP 是感知重要点，也叫感知拐点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 375.73,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "做法很贪心：先取首尾两点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 379.35,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "每轮找离当前折线最远的那个点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 383,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "加进来，重画折线，再找。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 386.49,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "取十个点，就把一百点压成十个拐点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 390.74,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "搜索时，起点只许落在这十个点上。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 394.79,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "这就是候选数从两万三掉到两千三的原因。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 399.36,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "代价是可能错过最优起点。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 402.79,
   "dur": 2.34,
   "speech": "最后是两个检验。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 405.31,
   "dur": 4.26,
   "speech": "ANOVA 的 F 比组间均方和组内均方。"
  },
  {
